{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And Abraham rose and bowed.</b> Abraham needed all of them, for even if Ephron sold him the field, Abraham was not permitted to make it a burial site without the consent of all the townspeople. Therefore he needed to rise in order to bow to all of them, even to those behind him. But in bowing to Ephron, who was an individual, he did not need to rise but only to bow before him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:21.914331493Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}